  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Support to Education Sector in East Jerusalem project builds on ongoing efforts to enhance the quality of the education system in East Jerusalem and addresses national priorities articulated in the Education Sector Strategy 2021-2023, with a focus on improving access to and quality of education. In terms of enhancing accessibility, the project aims to tackle the shortage of classrooms in East Jerusalem, which has led to overcrowding in schools.In this regard, the project aims to complement</narrative>
